                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "14a90987-d8d2-4dc1-90b5-2d84d09d0cb5",
                        "entry_id": "cf9ef348-bb0c-38fe-9417-fc66d8db4b7d",
                        "tags": [
                            "participle",
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "manœuvred"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6394b76c-9f57-472c-8714-f51ae35f1897",
                        "entry_id": "cf9ef348-bb0c-38fe-9417-fc66d8db4b7d",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "manœuvred"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a58bbb82-00bd-3cdc-9a91-bd3b6bc7b727",
                        "entry_id": "cf9ef348-bb0c-38fe-9417-fc66d8db4b7d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dated spelling of manoeuvre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23d55062-bba7-457d-b52c-8a2f6472be5d",
                                "sense_id": "a58bbb82-00bd-3cdc-9a91-bd3b6bc7b727",
                                "text": "We can ask how long it was before the team scored its first goal; or how long the centre-forward spent in manœuvring the ball towards the goal; and even how long the ball was in flight between his kicking it and its going between the goal-posts. But we cannot ask how many seconds were occupied in the scoring of the goal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "959bcdcb-3941-4565-a148-006bacff9afe",
                                "sense_id": "a58bbb82-00bd-3cdc-9a91-bd3b6bc7b727",
                                "text": "Mr.Marples has thus manœuvred himself into a corner."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8375b799-3942-45b7-bf9b-33e1d83d93fe",
                                "sense_id": "a58bbb82-00bd-3cdc-9a91-bd3b6bc7b727",
                                "text": "My face was being pushed into the wall, when my brother, Neil, arrived behind me. He forced the palms of his hands flat against the wall, either side of my head, and used the leverage to push back, creating a little space for me to manœuvre in."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
