                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cde1b487-f336-45f1-a76d-7d516105abfc",
                                "sense_id": "3879eca3-28dd-3709-bb92-87243357bbe5",
                                "text": "We can ask how long it was before the team scored its first goal; or how long the centre-forward spent in manœuvring the ball towards the goal; and even how long the ball was in flight between his kicking it and its going between the goal-posts. But we cannot ask how many seconds were occupied in the scoring of the goal."
                            }
